<title>USA: Franklin Electric Q4 net up on sales gain.</title>
<headline>Franklin Electric Q4 net up on sales gain.</headline>
<dateline>BLUFFTON, Ind. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franklin Electric Co Inc said Friday it accomplished its goal of returning to a long-term profit growth trend, posting net income of $7.8 million in the fourth quarter ended December 28.</p>
<p>The company reported earnings of $6.0 million in the fourth quarter of 1995.</p>
<p>Franklin Electric said sales in the latest period reached $85.4 million, up from $74.0 million one year ago.</p>
<p>The company makes submersible electric motors and electronic products for residential and industrial applications. Its shares were unchanged Friday at 46-1/2.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
